## Requirements

- Python 3.14
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
uv run pre-commit install
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run

```bash
uv run fastapi dev src/main.py
```

The health check is served at http://127.0.0.1:8000/health.

## Checks

```bash
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format .
uv run pytest
```

